cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "Telecommunications Accessibility and Resilience of Australian Evacuation Facilities"

message: >
  If you use this software, datasets, or implementations
  in academic work, please cite this repository.

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Laird"
    given-names: "Brianna"
    affiliation: "Deakin University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-9841-3691"

abstract: >
  A probabilistic geospatial framework for assessing telecommunications
  accessibility and resilience at Australian evacuation facilities.
  The software integrates evacuation facility locations,
  telecommunications infrastructure, bushfire and flood hazards,
  and administrative boundaries to evaluate coverage, infrastructure
  redundancy, and service continuity under different deployment
  scenarios and hazard conditions.

keywords:
  - Disaster Risk Reduction
  - Evacuation Planning
  - Telecommunications Accessibility
  - Telecommunications Resilience
  - Geospatial Analysis
  - Probabilistic Modelling

